From: mochiOS maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] mboot: publish an explicitly prepared ephemeral RAM block backend

Reuse Linux brd and the existing GPT, grant and block-control mechanisms.
Publish only after the explicit boot profile has copied its actual image and
validated both GPT copies. No PCI requester, DMA or persistent storage claim.

